# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sam's Painting — environment variables
#
# Copy to .env.local for local development. In production these are set in the
# Vercel dashboard under Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables.
#
# There is exactly ONE required variable. Everything else about lead delivery
# (the From address and the recipient inbox) is configured in code, in
# app/api/quote/route.ts, because those are not secrets.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# REQUIRED — Resend API key for quote-form lead delivery.
# Get it from https://resend.com/api-keys
# The sending domain (tradeleadsmarketing.com) must be verified in Resend.
# Without this the quote form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client,
# so a lead is never lost — but nothing arrives in the inbox automatically.
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
